      "claim": "4-Phenylbutyrate, an ionizable aromatic carboxylic acid, has 78% absolute oral bioavailability in humans.",
      "card_ids": ["C01", "C43"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Perindopril, an ester prodrug of a proline ACE inhibitor, has 66–95% absolute oral bioavailability in fasted humans, but the active diacid perindoprilat has only 19 ± 7% availability in normal volunteers after oral prodrug; this is weak contradictory context because the query is not an ester prodrug.",
      "card_ids": ["C17", "C13", "C39"]
    },
